REGENT OF PADANG PARIAMAN
PROVINCE OF WEST SUMATRA
REGIONAL REGULATION OF PADANG PARIAMAN REGENCY
NUMBER 6 YEAR 2017
CONCERNING
WOMEN'S EMPOWERMENT AND CHILD PROTECTION
BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD
REGENT OF PADANG PARIAMAN,

Considering : a. that to guarantee Women's Empowerment and Child Protection in accordance with human dignity and to receive Protection from Violence, discrimination and other violations, legal certainty is necessary;
b. that to provide legal certainty in the implementation of Women's Empowerment and Child Protection as well as to carry out mandatory Regional government affairs, regulation in the form of a Regional Regulation is necessary;
c. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a and letter b, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning Women's Empowerment and Child Protection;

In View of : 1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;
2. Law Number 12 Year 1956 concerning the Establishment of Autonomous Regional Regencies within the Provincial Region of Central Sumatra (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1956 Number 25));
3. Law Number 39 Year 1999 concerning Human Rights (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1999 Number 165, Supplement to the State Gazette Number 3886);
4. Law Number 23 Year 2002 concerning Child Protection (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2002 Number 109, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4235) as amended by Law Number 35 Year 2014 concerning Amendment to Law Number 23 Year 2002 concerning Child Protection (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2014 Number 397, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5606);
5. Law.......
