6. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 1 Year 2010 Concerning Minimum Service Standards in the Field of Integrated Services for Women and Children Victims of Violence;
7. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 11 Year 2011 Concerning Policy for the Development of Child-Friendly Regencies;

